# S2 build outputs. run-s2.sh builds to a container-local CARGO_TARGET_DIR
# (/tmp/dl-target) to dodge the SELinux ld denial on the :Z bind mount, but a
# direct `cargo build` on the host would drop a local target/ here — ignore it.
# (The repo root also carries **/target/.)
/target/

# Cargo.lock is COMMITTED for this peer (S11 full-closure pin) via the root
# .gitignore negation — do NOT ignore it here.
